## Summary
Brazil's President Lula aims to establish direct contact with President Trump to bypass Senator Rubio, whom he labels "anti-Latin America". This move is part of Lula's strategy to "neutralize" Rubio's influence. The effort reflects geopolitical tensions and alignments in Latin American policy.

## Key Points
- Brazil's Lula seeks direct contact with Trump
- Aim is to bypass Senator Rubio
- Lula calls Rubio "anti-Latin America"


